<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="2.6">
  <book code="PHP" style="id">Baebu Thyaa</book>
  <para style="h">FILIPI</para>
  <para style="toc1">Philippians</para>
  <para style="toc2">FILIPI</para>
  <para style="toc3">Fil</para>
  <para style="mt">FILIPI HAE</para>
  <para style="mt2">KALAN PAUL CCAKY</para>
  <para style="mt2">Philippians</para>
  <para style="imt">Byalaanmaw</para>
  <para style="im">
    <char style="bk">Filipi hae kalan Paul Ccaky</char> hynh Paul nynh Europe ram, Rom nynh a ukpaw Mesidonia pee kya masaty a raepaw khriccaawbuu kalan a kypaw nynh thua. Thong kya Paul a um lya, ccangpaw Khriccaaw ryalahtu hae nynh dou hae zah, vawsawnaw a tung lya te Filipi khriccaawbuu kya ccangpyaseinaw nynh lungriathaenaw a pya lyaze a ky hae paw nynh thua. Tuh-e ccaky tuh lungtuanaw te ngaengannaw khate beih zah Paul nynh Jesu Khri kya zynnaw akhupi a hoinaw liate tuh-e tuh a langsah.</para>
  <para style="ip">Thong lungkhu ahobou ccyh kyaze amaw bawm nawlan Filipi Khriccaaw hae nynh lasung oun ky hae paw lungtuanaw langsaku nawlan zeipaw ccaky nynh thua. Amaw nynh minmin tuh runaw teing hae salamah lungthawsaenaw te lungtynnaw a hoi nawlan hae ccyhhoy a muepaw kha mah minmin thawpya nawlan a mang. Pookunaw, karankunaw te ukpaw thua leite Jesu ozia zakawsangsakunaw a hoi nawlan hae thawccinaw a ngia hae. Khri ryte minmin hiinnaw kyngkunaw tuh Judah kawbya phunglang hae zuinaw liate thua leite zynnaw liate a ccou hae paw Pachia thawccinaw lasung nynh thua. Khri te a kyngkuh hae paw kya Pachia nynh pyapaw daenaw te lungtuanaw kong kha mah a zei.</para>
  <para style="ip">Hynh-e ccaky kya lungtuanaw, ngaengannaw, lunglokunaw te Khriccaaw zynnaw te hiinnaw kya teing khonaw hae hynh mah syntaw nawlan te a langsah. Filipi khriccaawbuu kya Paul nynh myarya a sungsahnaw hae kha a langsaku.</para>
  <para style="iot">Alungkhu Umpaw</para>
  <para style="io1">Byalaanmaw — 1.1-11</para>
  <para style="io1">Paul umnaw kya uccaw acyihkuhpaw — 1.12-26</para>
  <para style="io1">Khri kya hiinnaw — 1.27—2.18</para>
  <para style="io1">Timote te Apafroditas hanlan paccynnaw hae — 2.19-30</para>
  <para style="io1">Ri lan hae paw te rhaw hae raeringnaw pyanaw — 3.1—4.9</para>
  <para style="io1">Paul te Filipi e ruiban hae — 4.10-20</para>
  <para style="io1">Athangnaw — 4.21-23</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Beihlangnaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Jesu Khri see hae Paul te Timote nynh Filipi khua um hae paw, Jesu Khri kya-e mithyaa hae balyn, pastor hae te Khriccaaw piccan hae kalan ccaw kae ky oh.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1.1: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 16:12">Loc 16.12</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ah Paaw Pachia te Bawipaw Jesu Khri kyate thawccinaw te daenaw tuh nae tungvaw kya la um sah.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="s1">Filipi hae elang Paul Sawsangnaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Nanning kae liathui oh takyhte ka Pachia kalan lungtuabya ka ho, <verse number="4" style="v" />saw ka sang takyhte nae balyn hanlan lungtuate tyty saw ka sang, <verse number="5" style="v" />pawccecize nanning tuh atakaw te atu cia thehoypaw ryalaw kya nae bawm oh. <verse number="6" style="v" />Nanning kya ahoypaw ryalaw a thotu Pachia nynh Jesu Khri Nin a thua cia tuh-e rya tuh a ccingsah cih cite zynkunaw ka hoi. <verse number="7" style="v" />Nanning balyn konglang hynhte ka tuapaw tuh ka hanlan accanpaw nynh thua, pawccecize thehoypaw kong thong ka ccawnaw kya thuasah, thehoypaw ka thadynkhaenaw kya thuasah, thehoypaw ka tynsahnaw kya thuasah nanning balyn tuh kamaw ryte Pachia thawccinaw a neethungkuh bua hae paw na thua oh keiccu nanning tuh ka thinlung kya na um oh. <verse number="8" style="v" />Pawccecize Jesu Khri thawccinaw te nanning balyn kha pawcih baban nynh kae ngae oh cipaw Pachia tuh ka ccaekia nynh thua. <verse number="9" style="v" />Saw ka sangpaw tuh, nae kya-e sungsakunaw tuh nynaw te byakhupaw phiathyanaw balyn kya houhouh alungthung nawlan, <verse number="10" style="v" />ahoy huaccepaw uccaw hae kha phiathyate na nythya nawlan oh, te Khri nin kyacia athyaapaw te ccaenaw um leipaw lang na tang nawlan oh, <verse number="11" style="v" />Pachia phu-e nawlan te thehoysah nawlan, Jesu Khri liate oun thuapaw dingnaw kya-e athae hae khate phe na bia nawlan oh saw ka sang.</para>
  <para style="s1">Khri hanlan Hiin</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Uteno hae, ka tungvaw acyihkuhpaw uccaw hae tuh thehoypaw houh a pazaeku nawlan nynh acyiku cipaw kha nyh oh ci ka ry. <verse number="13" style="v" />Ou tuhte Khri keiccu thong ka ccawpaw tuh siapharan inn a rintu hae balyn te tuhlaepaw miakaw nynh a ny hae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1.13: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 28:30">Loc 28.30</ref></char></note> <verse number="14" style="v" />Uteno hae alunghua tuh, thong ka ccaw keiccuze Bawipaw kya zynkunaw hoi hae zah, Pachia byaho lan ri leite rawthungnaw houh a hoi hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Abang nynh eiungnaw te pekunaw lante Khri kong kha a ho hae, thuasalama abang nynh thinlung hoypaw te a ho hae. <verse number="16" style="v" />Tuhte a ho hae paw nynh kae tuh thehoypaw kha thadynkhae khylan khang ka thuapaw kha nyh hae zah sungsakunaw te a ho hae. <verse number="17" style="v" />Mingccang hae nynh thinlung ccaccing te thua leite, mimaw hanlan karankute, thong ka ccawnaw kya houh ka teing nawlan Khri kong kha a ho hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tuhteze pawte? Pawpawte a ho hae zemah, vawnin bya te athua zemah, thanccingte athua zemah, Khri kong tuh ho athua mamin; tuin kya kae tuh ka lungtua. Athua, ka lungtua ung cih.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Pawccecize nanning sawsangnaw liate thuasah, Jesu Khri Muisaw bawmnaw liate thuasah tuh-e tuh ka lue nawlan yn tang cih cipaw ka ny. <verse number="20" style="v" />Kae nynh pawpawte mah maethya leite, ka cyimae hawte myarya rawhoyte ka hiin zemah, ka chi zemah Khri tuh atu mah ka pyn kya hangthung athua zungzae cih cite kou ka ngaehoi. <verse number="21" style="v" />Pawccecize kae ka hanlan tuh, hiinnaw hynh Khri thua zah chinaw hynh amia. <verse number="22" style="v" />Thuasalama pynsaw kya ka hiin ze, tuh-e tuh ka ryalaw kya-e athae nynh thua, tuhzemah pawmou ka poku cih cipaw ka nyh khyh. <verse number="23" style="v" />Kae tuh tuh-e ccangning laku areihkunaw kya nynh ka um. E hiinnaw hynh cciatawte Khri ryte umkheih lan ka ry, tuh-e tuh myarya ahoy huapaw nynh thua. <verse number="24" style="v" />Thuasalama pynsaw kya ka hiin ung lanpaw tuh nae hanlan aho huapaw nynh thua. <verse number="25" style="v" />Tuh-e tuh ccaerarih lan ka ny keiccuze, zynnaw kya na lethung nawlan oh te nae lungtua nawlan kae tuh nanning balyn ryte ka um ung cih cipaw ka ny. <verse number="26" style="v" />Tetuh nae kalan bua kae thua te, kae ka liate nanning tuh Khri Jesu kya houh na pookuh cih oh.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Pawpawte athua zemah, Khri thehoypaw te angaekuhpaw ziazae khate hiin oh, tuhteze nynh kamaw kae thua zah kae muih oh ze thuasah, kamaw ka um khyh zemah thuasah nanning tuh thehoypaw te asekuhpaw zynnaw hanlan tuanaw ccangkheit te na zuakuh oh zah, thinlung ccangkheit te tynkaring lan na thadyn oh cipaw ka thae cih. <verse number="28" style="v" />Nae rhaw hae kha rih nan oh. Tuh-e tuh minmin ronaw hanlan a langsakuhpaw muihsahnaw nynh thua, thuasalama nanning hanlan tuh khumnaw nynh thua, tuh-e tuh Pachia nynh a cyipaw nynh thua. <verse number="29" style="v" />Pawccecize Khri zyn lanpaw kyalya thua leite, Khri hanlan teingbia lanpaw kha mah aning nynh ae pyabia oh, <verse number="30" style="v" />ka la teingpaw kha na muih vae oh zah atu na thae oh hawte ka teingpaw rhawdounaw te alokuhpaw kha na teingbua oh.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1.30: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 16:19-40">Loc 16.19-40</ref></char></note></para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Khri Zakawsangsakunaw Dosuinkunaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tukeiccuze Khri kya thawzung pyakunaw ccangkhakheit, sungsakunaw kya-e ngaengannaw ccangkhakheit te Muisaw kya-e vaeccawkunaw ccangkhakheit, thawccikunaw te ngaethyaumsakunaw ccangkhakheit a um ze, <verse number="2" style="v" />lunglokute alokuhpaw sungsakunaw hoi biate, nawccawkheihnaw te tuanaw ccangkheit hoi biate nanning nynh ka lungtuanaw kha yn ccingsah oh. <verse number="3" style="v" />Karankunaw, pooku minthaan rynaw te pawsang mah cyih nan oh, ming hae kha naemaw laeze ahoy huapaw lante zakawsangsakunaw thinlung te tua oh. <verse number="4" style="v" />Nanning lu raveih nynh mawmaw thanenaw kyalya kha do leite ming hae thanenaw kha mah dobia oh. <verse number="5" style="v" />Khri Jesu kya a umpaw hynh-e tuanaw hynh nanning kya mah la um sah,</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Khri tuh Pachia muinsan</para>
  <para style="q2">phang a ke pite,</para>
  <para style="q1">Pachia ryte nginkunaw kha</para>
  <para style="q2">luade lante tuakuh khyh,</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />tuhlaeze amaw a thuanaw</para>
  <para style="q2">balyn kha vua zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">see muinsan kha lawkute</para>
  <para style="q2">ccungccaw alo lante yn pui.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ccungccaw muinsan lante</para>
  <para style="q2">yn langkuh zah zakawsangsakute</para>
  <para style="q1">chinaw kyacia—</para>
  <para style="q2">vaelantung kya chi ciate heize</para>
  <para style="q2">kaw a ngae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tukeiccuze Pachia nynh mah</para>
  <para style="q2">amaw kha kou hangthung zah</para>
  <para style="q1">min balyn laeze</para>
  <para style="q2">alesae huapaw min kha a pya,</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />tukeiccuze vaawlang um hae paw,</para>
  <para style="q2">laephi vaw um hae paw te</para>
  <para style="q1">lae kaw um hae paw miakaw nynh</para>
  <para style="q2">Jesu min kya</para>
  <para style="q2">ccukharu a tung cih hae zah,<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2.10-11: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 45:23">Isa 45.23</ref> (LXX)</char></note></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Paaw Pachia phu-enaw hanlan</para>
  <para style="q2">munglae miakaw nynh</para>
  <para style="q1">Jesu Khri tuh Bawi nynh thua,</para>
  <para style="q2">a ci cih hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tukeiccuze ka sungsah hae paw, ka kaw zungzae na ngae oh zah, kamaw ka um lya kyalya thua leite, atu kamaw ka um khyh lya mah kaw houh na ngae oh hawte, rawri thyngku biate naemaw khumnaw elang ryalah oh; <verse number="13" style="v" />pawccecize amaw kya-e ahoypaw eenaw kha ry khylan te cyi khylan nae lungkhu kya ryalahpaw tuh Pachia nynh thua.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ccohku leite, eiku leite pawpaw balyn kha cyih oh, <verse number="15" style="v" />tuhteze nynh a thyaruhpaw te a ccouseikuhpaw she kya ccaenaw um leipaw, seinaw a hoi leipaw, a minthu leipaw, Pachia ccaaw hae lang na tang cih oh zah, laephi kya awsi hawte tuh-e hae laku na aw cih oh.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2.15: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 32:5">Deu 32.5</ref></char></note> <verse number="16" style="v" />Hiinnaw bya kha varyng kyngkuh oh; tuhteze nynh kae tuh alakaw lan ka ccuehan khyh zah rya ka lahhan khyh cite Khri nin kya ka pookuh kho cih. <verse number="17" style="v" />Nae zynnaw te asekuhpaw pyapaw te silawnaw vawlan khe kamaw hynh niapaw silawnaw lante bu a la thua heize, ka lungtua zah nanning balyn ryte ka lungtua. <verse number="18" style="v" />Tuhawte nanning mah nae lungtua sah lah, kamaw ryte nae lungtua sah.</para>
  <para style="s1">Timote te Epafroditas</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Nae konglang kha he ka thae te ka ngaengan nawlan aro mawze Timote kha nae kalan saw lan Bawipaw Jesu kya ngaehoinaw ka hoi. <verse number="20" style="v" />Aning hawte nanning thanenaw hanlan hoyte peki cih paw lu kheit san ka hoi khyh. <verse number="21" style="v" />Ming hae balyn nynh Jesu Khri hanlan tua leite mimaw hanlan nynh a tuaku hae. <verse number="22" style="v" />Thuasalama ccapaw nynh paaw ryte rya a law hawte, Timote tuh kae te thehoypaw rya kae lawkheih keiccuze a ryalawnaw kha na ny oh. <verse number="23" style="v" />Tukeiccuze ka konglang pawte nynh acyiku cipaw ccahe ka nyh te, amaw kha nae kalan palou saw lan ka ngaehoi, <verse number="24" style="v" />kamaw mah aro mawze nae kalan kae thua cih cite Bawipaw kha ka doliaku.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Te Epafroditas hynh nae kalan saw aho cite ka tua, aning tuh ka neitaw, rya kae lahkheihpaw, rhaw kae doukheihpaw, ka hobounaw kya rya yn lawpahpaw, nae zeccuetu nynh thua, <verse number="26" style="v" />pawccecize aning tuh accih cipaw na thae oh keiccuze nae balynte kou ae ngae oh zah a lungriathae. <verse number="27" style="v" />Aning tuh vya chih lan a ccih ccaccing. Thuasalama Pachia nynh ngaethya a umsah, amaw kyalya thua leite, kae zemah ngaethyanaw ka tungchih khyh nawlan ngaethya yn umsah. <verse number="28" style="v" />Tukeiccuze amaw kha bua na muih oh te nae lungtua nawlan te kae mah ka lungriathaenaw azyahua nawlan amaw kha thawmuinte kae saw. <verse number="29" style="v" />Tukeiccuze Bawipaw kya amaw kha myarya lungtuate la ccou oh; te khahcihawpaw ccungccaw hae kha sawtuanaw la pya oh. <verse number="30" style="v" />Pawccecize nanning nynh nae pya kho lei oh paw bawmnaw kha pya khylan a hiinnaw kha duaaku leite, Khri ryalaw hanlan vya a chibia.</para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Ahmepaw Dingnaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Uteno hae, nyathyakou ka ho rypaw tuh, Bawipaw kya nae lungtua sah. Phe alokuhpaw kha nae kalan bua zei lanpaw hynh kae ka hanlan pawtua-ung khyh zah nae hanlan khynnaw nynh thua.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ui hae kha la raeringkuh oh, ahoy leipaw rya a lahtu hae kha la raeringkuh oh, mih vingdung a awkuh hae paw kha la raeringkuh oh. <verse number="3" style="v" />Pawccecize aening tuh Muisaw kya Pachia beik hae paw, Khri Jesu kya lungtua hae paw, te pynsaw lante zynkunaw a hoi lei hae paw, vingdungawkuh ccaccing hae paw nynh ah thua oh.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tuhzemah kae mah pynsaw kya zynkunaw a hoipaw nynh ka thua. Lukhakheit nynh pynsaw kya zynkunaw ka hoi cite a tuaku ze kae tuh houh ka hoi: <verse number="5" style="v" />nin taryanaw kya vingdungawkuhpaw, Israel minphuin, Benjamin ciihan, Hebru hae kyate yn thopaw Hebru paw, Kawbya te asekuh lante Farasipaw;<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3.5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 23:6">Loc 23.6</ref>, <ref loc="ACT 26:5">26.5</ref>; <ref loc="ROM 11:1">Rom 11.1</ref></char></note> <verse number="6" style="v" />beiknaw kya lungthawsaenaw te asekuh lante khriccaawbuu tungvaw a tuaasahtupaw, Kawbya kya umpaw dingnaw te asekuh lante ccaenaw um leipaw nynh ka thua.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3.6: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 8:3">Loc 8.3</ref>, <ref loc="ACT 22:4">22.4</ref>, <ref loc="ACT 26:9-11">26.9-11</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Thuasalama ka hanlan a la thanepaw tuh-e hae balyn tuh Khri keiccuze shungnawpaw lang nynh ka tua vae. <verse number="8" style="v" />Tuhpiaze, ka Bawipaw Khri Jesu nynaw asung-e huaccepaw keiccuze pawpaw balyn kha shungnawpaw lang ka tua. Khri keiccuze pawpaw balyn marya ka shung zah, amaw kha mue kho nawlan tuh-e hae tuh athupaw lang nynh ka ria, <verse number="9" style="v" />amaw te tynkaring lan kyngku nawlan Kawbya liate muepaw kamaw dingnaw kha ka hoi khyh, thuasalama Khri zynnaw liate muepaw dingnaw, zynnaw liate athuapaw Pachia kya-e dingnaw kha nynh ka hoi. <verse number="10" style="v" />Ka rypaw tuh Khri te a thoothuinaw kya-e thungnaw kha nyte, a teingnaw kha neethungkubua te a chinaw kya chibua kha nynh thua. <verse number="11" style="v" />A chih hae paw kyate thoothuinaw kalan pawpawte zemah phyabua ka ry.</para>
  <para style="s1">Eenaw Kuetung kalan Ccue</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Kae nynh tuh-e tuh phe ka mue vae, tuhkhyhze eenaw kya phe ka thua vae cipaw thua khyh; thuasalama Khri Jesu nynh kae kha amaw kya-e lang yn raeku vae keiccuze kae nynh tuh-e tuh ccou kho nawlan palei ka zuaku. <verse number="13" style="v" />Uteno hae, tuh-e tuh phe ka ccou vae cite ka tuakuh khyh, thuasalama ka cyipaw uccaw ccangkheit tuh: nulang e uccaw hae kha ningte, malang umpaw uccaw hae kha phya lan ka zuaku, <verse number="14" style="v" />Khri Jesu liate Pachia nynh vaawlang oun konaw te asekuhpaw lasung kha mue khylan eenaw kuetung kalan ka ccuebua. <verse number="15" style="v" />Tukeiccuze piccan athua vae paw aening nynh tuhcihawpaw tuanaw kha hoi oh sih; te nanning nynh hankhakheit kya ccanglang te na tua oh ze, tuh-e maw tuh Pachia nynh nae kya ae phypah cih oh. <verse number="16" style="v" />Pawpawte athua zemah, ah zui vae oh paw phung thyhte tynkaring lan po cceih oh sih.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Uteno hae, kamaw thydokuh hae paw thua oh, kaening kyate na mue oh paw dosuinku lanpaw thyhte a hiin hae paw kha la dokuh oh.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3.17: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 4:16">1Ko 4.16</ref>, <ref loc="1CO 11:1">11.1</ref></char></note> <verse number="18" style="v" />Pawccecize ccungccaw patae tuh Khri vaelantung kha rawsete a hiin hae, tuhte a hiin hae cipaw; minmin kong kha palei kae hopah vae oh, atu mitphi te bua kae hopya oh. <verse number="19" style="v" />Tuh-e hae athangnaw tuh ronaw nynh thua; mih pachia tuh mih vuebua nynh thua, maethya lan umpaw kyakhe a pookuh hae, mih thinlung kya laephi uccaw hae kha nynh a um. <verse number="20" style="v" />Thuasalama aening kya-e ramccungccaw thuanaw tuh vaawlang khua kya nynh a um; tuin kyate yn thua lanpaw Khumtu, Bawipaw Jesu Khri kha ah ngaehoi oh. <verse number="21" style="v" />Pawpaw balyn kha amaw zakaw nung khonawpaw thungnaw liate, anyaapaw aening pyn hynh aphu-epaw amaw pyn alo lante oun rulae cih.</para>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" />
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tukeiccuze ka lungtuanaw te ka bawilukhung na thua oh paw, ka sungsah hae zah kou ka ngae hae paw, ka uno hae, Bawipaw kya tynkaring lan thadyn oh, kou ka sungsah hae paw.</para>
  <para style="s1">Hyynaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Euodia te Syntykhe nynh Bawipaw kya tuanaw a loku nawlan hae thawte ka ngia hae. <verse number="3" style="v" />Alungzipaw ryalahkheihtu nang kha mah, hynh-e nopi hae hynh na bawm nawlan hae kae ngia; pawccecize minmin tuh kamaw ry, Klement ry, hiinnaw ccauh kya mih min um hae paw tuhlaepaw kae te rya kae lahkheih hae paw ryte thehoypaw rya kya ryalahtu hae nynh thua hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Bawipaw kya nae lungtua zungzae sah. Bua kae ho hin, nae lungtua sah. <verse number="5" style="v" />Ccungccaw miakaw nynh nae lungnenaw kha nyh hae sah. Bawipaw tuh nae pe a um. <verse number="6" style="v" />Pawpaw konglang mah nae thinphang nan sah; pawpaw balyn kya lungtuabya hote, sawsangnaw te ngianaw liate na ngia ry oh paw kha Pachia nysah oh. <verse number="7" style="v" />Ccungccaw tuanaw balyn nynh a phya kho leipaw Pachia kya-e daenaw nynh Jesu Khri liate nae thinlung te nae tuanaw kha ae khynsah cih oh.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Nyathyakou lang uteno hae, ahmepaw, sawtua lan umpaw, adingpaw, athyaapaw, ry lan umpaw, thehoysah lan umpaw; ccangkhakheit tuh aphute lanze, thehoysah lan angaeku lanze tuh-e hae tuh nae thinlung kya la tua oh. <verse number="9" style="v" />Kamaw kyate na ccangku oh paw, na lawku oh paw, na thae oh paw te na muih oh paw kha la cyih oh, te daenaw Pachia tuh nae kya a um cih.</para>
  <para style="s1">Lasung hanlan Luungkunaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Kamaw nae do-oihnaw oh kha atu nyathya kya bua na langsakuh oh zah Bawipaw kya myarya ka lungtua; thanccingte, kamaw do-oih rynaw na la hoi oh salamah, ccyhhoypaw na la mue khyh oh. <verse number="11" style="v" />Ka hobou keiccuze ka hopaw thua khyh, pawccecize kae tuh pawcihawpaw kya ka um zemah lungccingkhaeku lan phe ka ccangku vae. <verse number="12" style="v" />Ryachinaw kya hiinzia ka thya zah hoirumnaw kya hiinzia ka thya; vueso zemah, vuelaw zemah, hoirum zemah, ryachi zemah teitei balyn kya te atyn-are kya umzia byaphi kha ka ccangkuh vae. <verse number="13" style="v" />Thawzung yn pyatupaw Khri liate pawpaw balyn ka cyih kho. <verse number="14" style="v" />Thuasalama ka vawsawnaw kha neethungkubua te kou hoy lan na cyi vae oh.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Thehoypaw honaw ka thotakaw lyaze, Mesidonia ram kyate he ka pou lya kha, ahlu pyanaw te muenaw kya nanning holeite pawpaw khriccaawbuu mah yn bawmpaw um khyh cipaw kha nanning Filipi hae nynh hoyte na ny oh.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4.15-16: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CO 11:9">2Ko 11.9</ref></char></note> <verse number="16" style="v" />Pawccecize Thesalonika khua ka um lya heize, ka hanlan ahoboupaw bawmnaw kha vaekheit lae alung lan nae ky oh.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4.16: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 17:1">Loc 17.1</ref></char></note> <verse number="17" style="v" />Lasung kha ka ccungkupaw thua khyh, na ccykunaw oh ccazing kya amia kha nynh kae ccungpya oh. <verse number="18" style="v" />Kae tuh phe beih lan nae pya oh zah azaw laelan ka hoi; amynkhuhpaw, Pachia lungrytungsahpaw, douccahpaw silawkunaw athuapaw, nae ky oh paw lasung hae kha Epafroditas kyate ka mue zah phe beih lan ka hoi.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4.18: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 29:18">Exo 29.18</ref></char></note> <verse number="19" style="v" />Te ka Pachia nynh a phu-enaw kya a hoirum thyhte nae hanlan ahoboupaw miakaw kha Khri Jesu liate ae ccingsahpah cih oh. <verse number="20" style="v" />Ah Paaw Pachia tuh zungzae te zungzae cia a phu-e sah. Amen.</para>
  <para style="s1">Nyathyakou Beihlangnaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Khri Jesu kya umpaw mithyaa hae balyn kha la beihlang oh. Kamaw te kae umkheihpaw uno hae nynh nanning kha ae beihlang oh. <verse number="22" style="v" />Mithyaa hae balyn nynh ae beihlang oh, abyapi lante Sizar siapharan inn kya um hae paw nynh ae beihlang oh.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Bawipaw Jesu Khri kya-e thawccinaw tuh nae balyn kya la um sah. Amen.</para>
</usx>